Phantom

Phantom contains software derived from Terax (crynta/terax-ai) and its
contributors. The integration baseline is Terax v0.9.0:
https://github.com/crynta/terax-ai/tree/v0.9.0

Phantom modifies the upstream project with a shared Rust core, a headless
browser and WebSocket gateway, persistent remote terminals, and Room-based
agent collaboration. See LICENSE for the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Bundled terminal components retain their upstream MIT notices:

- Coder's ghostty-web (legacy compatibility bridge):
  https://github.com/coder/ghostty-web
  packages/ghostty-core/LICENSE

- Ghostty, by Mitchell Hashimoto and the Ghostty contributors
  (adapted core and official ABI evaluation artifact):
  https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty
  packages/ghostty-core/adapted/LICENSE.ghostty

- Restty, by Wiedy Mi (selected low-level bridge code):
  https://github.com/wiedymi/restty
  packages/ghostty-core/adapted/LICENSE.restty

- xterm.js and its predecessors (adapted WebGL renderer):
  https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js
  src/modules/terminal/ghostty/webgl/LICENSE.xterm-js

Other dependencies are distributed under their respective licenses.
